---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The State of Real Estate in South Florida — 2026 Report | The One Group"
  description="Free data-backed report: how 60 South Florida real estate businesses show up in AI search — and the missed-call leak costing them ~$1,200 per call."
>

  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 via-white to-brand-50/30 dark:from-gray-950 dark:via-gray-950 dark:to-brand-950/20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Free Market Report</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-bold mt-4 mb-4">
        The State of Real Estate<br class="hidden sm:block" /> in South Florida — 2026
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        A data-backed snapshot of 60 real estate businesses across the Palm Beach / Broward corridor.
        See how they show up in AI search — and the revenue leak most never notice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key stats -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">60</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Businesses Profiled</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">43%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Publish a Contact Email</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">57%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Have a Website AI Can Find</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">82%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">High-Intent Prospects (8+)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 rounded-r-xl p-6 mt-8">
        <p class="text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 font-medium">
          <strong>This is real data, not marketing.</strong> Every number below comes from live research of 60 actual South Florida real estate businesses, compiled by The One Group.AI.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why it matters -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900/40">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-6">Why This Matters</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mb-8">
        The #1 revenue leak for real estate businesses in this market isn't competition or pricing — it's
        <strong>lead follow-up and commission leakage</strong>. Across the 60 businesses we surveyed, we estimate
        roughly <strong>16 are losing calls every single day</strong> because nobody answers fast enough.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/20 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-red-800 dark:text-red-300">
          <strong>The missed-call math:</strong> each missed call in a service trade is worth ~<strong>$1,200</strong> in
          lifetime revenue. A business taking 20 calls a day is quietly writing off ~<strong>$6,000 a week</strong> in
          calls nobody answered — and those calls go to whoever picks up first.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Where they cluster -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-6">Where They Cluster</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mb-8">Top markets by concentration of the 60 businesses profiled:</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">11</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Boynton Beach</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">11</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Palm Beach Gardens</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">10</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Boca Raton</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">9</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Lake Worth</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">9</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Jupiter</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">8</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">West Palm Beach</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The opportunity -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900/40">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-6">The Opportunity</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mb-6">
        The real estate businesses that win are the ones that <strong>text a missed call back within 5 minutes</strong>.
        Callers who get a response that fast are <strong>100x more likely to actually connect</strong>.
        The ones still relying on voicemail and call-backs are bleeding leads to the faster office down the street.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-xl p-6">
          <p class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300"><strong>1. Instant text-back on missed calls</strong> — a caller never waits, so the lead never goes elsewhere.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-xl p-6">
          <p class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300"><strong>2. AI answering every lead in under 60 seconds</strong> — no more "we'll call you back tomorrow."</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-xl p-6">
          <p class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300"><strong>3. 24/7 coverage</strong> — the 2 AM call that used to hit voicemail now books an appointment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Email capture: Get the full report (Kit form) -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900/40">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Free Download</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold mt-3 mb-3">Get the Full Report</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">
        Drop your email and we'll send you the complete report — plus a free 60-second AI Visibility Score.
      </p>

      <!-- Kit form embed. Replace FORM_ID with your Kit form's embed ID (from Kit:
           Forms → your form → Embed → copy the form's unique ID). When empty, we
           fall back to the AI Visibility Score CTA so the page still converts. -->
      <div id="kit-form-wrap">
        <form id="kit-form" action="https://app.kit.com/forms/FORM_ID/subscriptions" method="post" class="hidden">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
            <input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@yourbusiness.com"
              class="w-full sm:flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none" />
            <input type="text" name="first_name" placeholder="First name"
              class="w-full sm:flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none" />
            <button type="submit"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25">
              Send Me the Report
            </button>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3">We'll email the report + your score. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <a id="kit-fallback" href="/ai-visibility-score"
        class="hidden inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25">
        Take the Free AI Visibility Score
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-4">Want Your Version?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">
        Get the full report, or see exactly where YOUR business shows up in AI search with a free 60-second AI Visibility Score.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/ai-visibility-score" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          Take the Free AI Visibility Score
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 border border-brand-200 dark:border-brand-800 hover:bg-brand-50 dark:hover:bg-brand-900/30 transition-colors">
          Talk to Us
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-6">
        Report generated from live local business research by The One Group.AI (August 2026).
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  // If the Kit form ID placeholder is still set, hide the form and show the
  // AI Visibility Score fallback so the page always converts.
  const kitForm = document.getElementById('kit-form');
  if (kitForm && kitForm.getAttribute('action').includes('FORM_ID')) {
    kitForm.classList.add('hidden');
    document.getElementById('kit-fallback').classList.remove('hidden');
  } else if (kitForm) {
    kitForm.classList.remove('hidden');
  }
</script>
